\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Repository pipeline from mathematical target to blocker-aware closeout.} The workflow begins with the arithmetic-Kakeya witness target and proceeds through witness formalization, the \texttt  {H1}{} CA design, ConceptEvolve bridge generation, and the benchmark/control plan. Every empirical claim is routed through a shared exact decoder/verifier. Because that component was absent in the audited snapshot, the pipeline correctly terminates in a pivot to verifier recovery rather than a proxy-metric success claim.\relax }}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
