\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {\texttt  {H1}{} representation and no-repair decoding.} The active CA lane does not emit images or free-form graphs. It emits typed symbolic fibers aligned with the witness grammar: a registry fiber for the active alphabet \(X\), stage-indexed edge fibers for the dictionaries \(f_i\), and a vertex fiber for \(T\) and singleton-supported \(R\) seeds. The decoder is intentionally strict: any malformed label, key, or seed support causes rejection rather than repair.\relax }}{8}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{3}{8}{\textbf {\Hone {} representation and no-repair decoding.} The active CA lane does not emit images or free-form graphs. It emits typed symbolic fibers aligned with the witness grammar: a registry fiber for the active alphabet \(X\), stage-indexed edge fibers for the dictionaries \(f_i\), and a vertex fiber for \(T\) and singleton-supported \(R\) seeds. The decoder is intentionally strict: any malformed label, key, or seed support causes rejection rather than repair.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
